<title>UK: Timah at 12.585 in London at 0833 GMT.</title>
<headline>Timah at 12.585 in London at 0833 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah was traded at $12.585 per GDR in London on Thursday at around 0833 GMT.</p>
<p>It recorded a low of $12.585 and a high of $12.75.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Wednesday was $12.7. One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
